# --- Defense in depth: these must NEVER end up in this repo. ---
# The export script (scripts/export-public.sh in the private repo) only ever
# copies an explicit allow-list, so nothing below should ever be produced by
# it — these entries exist so a future mistake in that script still can't be
# committed here without a forced `git add -f`. See ../OSINTCollectionCore's
# docs/adr/ADR-003-two-repo-public-export-model.md for why.
docs/architecture/
docs/specs/
docs/governance/
docs/security/
docs/operations/
docs/developer/
docs/adr/
docs/claude/
.claude/CLAUDE.md
